            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.7 — A new welcome, a new icon</h3>
<ul>
<li>A brand-new full-screen welcome: a living gradient that follows your pointer, colors you can try across the whole screen, and shortcuts you can press to learn. See it any time from Help › Show Welcome.</li>
<li>A new app icon.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
